      "message": "[error] Line 769: 🔴 `previousLocalMedia` is selected by `mediaIndex`, but `mediaIndex` is based on the **new** offer’s emitted m-lines (`localSession_-\u003emedia_count`), and `createOffer()` skips disabled entries. If any m-line is disabled/removed/reordered, this index can point to a different prior media section, so the re-offer may copy the wrong transport/MID/PT/RTCP-fb (e.g., video inheriting audio MID/PT). This can produce invalid or incompatible SDP. Match prior m-lines by a stable identity (MID first, then validated media type), or keep positional alignment by emitting inactive sections instead of compacting enabled-only media.",
